Boot and shutdown artwork
-------------------------

The generated Plymouth themes use Fedora's official spinner and logo assets
from the installed plymouth-theme-spinner package. Those assets and the
Plymouth plugins retain their package licenses and trademarks; they are not
covered by the project's MIT license. The runtime export includes the source
RPM identities and package license files.

The orientation signature and test fixtures are sparse pixel classifications
from Xiaomi OS2.0.6.0.VMYCNXM imagefv.elf, not redistributed firmware or complete
logo images. The pinned source hash and regeneration tool are documented in
build/scripts/generate-boot-logo-signature.py.

Firmware and factory data
-------------------------

Qualcomm, Xiaomi and Cirrus firmware remain subject to their respective
licenses. Inclusion in a download bundle does not place firmware under MIT.
Redistribution permissions and notices must be established for each distributed
firmware set before publication.
The kernel source adaptations do not redistribute device firmware or private
calibration data.

Device-specific calibration, WLAN and Bluetooth addresses and factory sensor
registry data are read from the user's tablet. They are not public source or
shared firmware assets and must not be distributed.
